# (1.5.0, step 7) The cue player: a piece's cues fire on the engine's bar and semicorchea (16th) clock with the calls
# PERFORM's keys and knobs make (a mute, a solo, a throw held, an effect held, a siren, the DJ filter ridden, a knob
# ridden), each on its step; a cue whose part ends first is dropped (a main's past the main, an outro's past the song);
# you can play on top (a key, a knob); a Set's Mix reads the next piece's list at the hand-over and plays it from its
# downbeat; the cues kept in WORK (a reboot); the Set page's Cues off: none played, said, saved.
# (build: DUB1_CUES=1) the cues played: run on build/host/amb_host_cues (the release plays none: nocues.amb)
listen
wait 1500
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
# Set mode, Transition Mix (the Set page: GLO twice); Cues on (KNOB 3), said with the page
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 400
expect view 28
said Cues On
spin K1 2
wait 300
spin K2 2
wait 300
expect par158 2
expect trans 2
expect cuesoff 0
# two short songs: Basic (no intro, Main 32 bars, Outro 16), then Chamber (Intro 16, Main 32, Outro 16)
turn PRESET 1
wait 600
tap HOME
wait 200
tap HOME
wait 300
spin K1 -2
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -2
wait 300
turn PRESET -1
wait 600
spin K1 -4
spin K2 -16
spin K3 -2
wait 300
expect piece 0
expect par15 >-1
# Basic's cues (its main from bar 0): the DJ filter Shut 60 at once, then opened over 2 bars; a chord throw a bar; the
# kick muted a bar; Freeze half a bar; Wail tapped; Motion ridden to 80 over 2 bars; the bass soloed a bar; the echo
# pushed in the outro's 3rd bar; and two never heard: a main's at bar 40 (the main is 32), an outro's at its bar 20
cue 0 m 0 0 macro 0 -30 0
cue 0 m 2 0 macro 0 0 32
cue 0 m 4 0 move 0 0 16
cue 0 m 6 0 mute 3 1 0
cue 0 m 7 0 mute 3 0 0
cue 0 m 8 0 fx 10 0 8
cue 0 m 9 4 siren 0 0 0
cue 0 m 10 0 knob 15 80 32
cue 0 m 13 0 solo 2 1 0
cue 0 m 14 0 solo 2 0 0
cue 0 m 40 0 move 1 0 16
cue 0 o 2 0 move 4 0 16
cue 0 o 20 0 mute 0 1 0
# Chamber's: the noise muted from its downbeat, back with its main; and 62 more (dub hold off, from its main's bar 20:
# nothing to hear), a list of 64, the most a piece has, to read at the hand-over while it plays
cue 1 i 0 0 mute 5 1 0
cue 1 m 0 0 mute 5 0 0
cue 1 m 20 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 20 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 20 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 20 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 21 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 21 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 21 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 21 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 22 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 22 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 22 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 22 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 23 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 23 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 23 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 23 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 24 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 24 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 24 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 24 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 25 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 25 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 25 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 25 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 26 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 26 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 26 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 26 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 27 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 27 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 27 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 27 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 28 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 28 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 28 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 28 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 29 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 29 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 29 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 29 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 30 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 30 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 30 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 30 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 31 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 31 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 31 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 31 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 32 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 32 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 32 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 32 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 33 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 33 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 33 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 33 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 34 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 34 4 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 34 8 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 34 12 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 35 0 hold 0 0 0
cue 1 m 35 4 hold 0 0 0
cuesave
expect slotcues0 13
expect slotcues1 64
cuelist 0
# mutated containers of this project, its cue lists' bytes among them: never a fault (container-asan), none read with
# its CRC not mended, every one read valid; written as WORK's newest and booted: taken whole or the version before
fuzz 20000
fuzzboot 300
expect slotcues0 13
# (a reboot: the cues are WORK's, in its frame)
reboot
wait 1500
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
expect slotcues0 13
expect slotcues1 64
expect piece 0
expect cuen 13
expect cuelive 0
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect playing 1
expect cuelive 1
expect mac0 -30
expect cuedone 3
# the filter's ride: its first step at once, Off by bar 4
bar 2
wait 30
expect mac0 >-30
expect mac0 <-27
bar 3
wait 30
expect mac0 >-18
expect mac0 <-12
bar 4
wait 30
expect mac0 0
expect cuemoves 1
bar 5
wait 30
expect cuemoves 0
# the kick muted a bar by a cue; played on top: its key taps it back on, the cue's unmute changes nothing then
bar 6
wait 30
expect mutes 8
tapkey w3
expect mutes 0
bar 7
wait 30
expect mutes 0
bar 8
wait 30
expect cuefx 1024
wait 900
expect cuefx 1024
wait 200
expect cuefx 0
# Wail tapped on bar 9's 5th semicorchea (16th), not before
bar 9
wait 30
expect sirenon 0
wait 600
expect sirenon 1
# Motion ridden by the engine only: the piece's own value stays (nothing to save)
bar 10
wait 30
expect epar15 !=80
bar 12
wait 30
expect epar15 80
expect dirty 0
bar 13
wait 30
expect solo 4
bar 14
wait 30
expect solo 0
# the main's bar 40 dropped once the outro is planned (bar 32): never fired
bar 33
expect cuemoves 0
bar 34
wait 30
expect song 3
expect cuemoves 16
bar 35
wait 30
expect cuemoves 0
# the hand-over (Mix): Chamber set at the outro's last bar, its list read then, none of it till its downbeat
irqreset
bar 47
wait 1500
expect trcue 1
expect piece 1
expect cuen 64
# (read while it plays: 512 bytes, 64 at a time, each an IRQ-off window of ~0.1 ms: no xrun, none as long as a page)
expect flashxruns 0
expect irqlong 0
expect irqmax <2
expect mutes 0
wait 1000
expect trcue 0
expect song 1
expect mutes 32
# (Basic's outro bar 20 never came: Basic's run over, 13 of 13 done or dropped, its Motion the piece's again)
expect epar15 !=80
bar 16
wait 30
expect mutes 0
wait 200
expect song 2
expect mutes 0
# stopped; the Set page's Cues off (said, saved): Basic again, none of its cues
tap PLAY
wait 500
expect playing 0
expect cuelive 0
turn PRESET -1
wait 600
expect piece 0
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 400
expect view 28
spin K3 -1
wait 300
said Cues Off
expect cuesoff 1
press GLO
wait 700
release GLO
wait 500
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 1500
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect cuesoff 1
expect slotcues0 13
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect playing 1
expect cuelive 0
expect mac0 0
bar 6
wait 30
expect mutes 0
bar 8
wait 30
expect cuefx 0
# on again mid-song: the cues ahead play, those past don't (the throw at bar 4, the mute at bar 6 left)
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 400
spin K3 1
wait 300
expect cuesoff 0
expect cuelive 1
expect cuedone 8
bar 13
wait 30
expect solo 4
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect cuelive 0
# (Decisions 7) the solo a cue made undone at the stop
expect solo 0
